    5. Connect adjacent frames in the cycle with L-shaped blue paths (1-2 turns), attaching at one cell on each frame's border. Ensure connectors don't overlap frames or each other.
    6. Verify the clockwise ordering of frames matches the cycle edge adjacency.
    7. Output = rotate interior colors one step clockwise; input is the constructed grid.
